# Override global gitignore for this plugin subtree.
# Fixtures intentionally embed .claude/ and .fake-plugin-cache/ as snapshots
# of project configurations under audit. Without these re-includes, contributors
# whose ~/.gitignore_global excludes .claude/ would silently drop fixture files
# from `git add` (caught during Phase 0.2 fixture work).
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!.fake-plugin-cache/
!.fake-plugin-cache/**
# Fixture CLAUDE.md and .mcp.json files are excluded by contributor global
# gitignores (same root cause as .claude/). Re-include them for this subtree.
!CLAUDE.md
!.mcp.json
!.claude-plugin/
